      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `a3340f6d2df4f01d9caa98a9d0ee5db89cc61f48f09f1418df5abb9babe57374--45300do012_201011.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Crime Victimisation, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010-11\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 17 of 17\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | ccbce6743fc82ba5fbc5dfefb5b6a5bd1cb49b8682dab9eacd1b20ea5bcacf08 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | c04e3de2391511c6f05d3dc17d1c2a070c71c0d404e697068210eddf14553ee9 | missing |\n| \"Table 1a\" | 3252602c93f680e8494299d6ae8e8d1868935b4d5ff7d66cd79ab2eec8c29bd9 | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | 1f92c7f64c78fd88d6070f6a2d46158c889e289e522ed71627ab348be960141b | missing |\n| \"Table 2a\" | c4ab22c0d3a5da7ff021d7e6ca288fe266a0ae66360381084e6ed4a8272fa34d | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | 40312c603f67cda4be1df8e1f0711baa62276704e670ddc1688b98c221229bc0 | missing |\n| \"Table 3a\" | a10965687f2be6fa1ad6a8c55dc7d6ce1224ef2bb250537aaf58f56429eb674c | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | 22eb25033d443ebfc0913dba6816d80fd866d291321c3838b9a9fd868eb18124 | missing |\n| \"Table 4a\" | 3a35399e5775b93d5db041609aaf2044b6def96036afcd97679079d758a0a8ad | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | 5e565fd2aa133c98f4b252ba481ae5ed3fcd9f4e450b1acae7ce1956e346afe9 | missing |\n| \"Table 5a\" | fa586a32e2fde710f421fc0885202c8eadcc555a0ab2f8ca55f53cef8b9e7150 | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | 067686b16b5b531a64de83e78080f34f323545d2f869097aa644b7fd02440c33 | missing |\n| \"Table 6a\" | 6caef10a1338aa0d7f885fb0735766f6fb7360a3c19fb17e65fe0ed57d07a118 | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | 84a09decb30fe558f7d8ab10537053408b7c0f3a8c06c0acd86e42bb0152bf5d | missing |\n| \"Table 7a\" | 26fd309158041ba87e17262c0c64e33d9948ab739fd2c8a98d7aab34f0e501ea | missing |\n| \"Table 8\" | c7560653b0f32b87fc42c0419c86aed7c9c9616b445eedcd90484fee729f2f0c | missing |\n| \"Table 8a\" | be75f05a2adb7a2f0215963eb227e00aa27674f8ff8d111e64c8f08fa17e28e8 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
